  "name": "BHPS Total Scoring",
  "status": "validated",
  "description": "Brief Histrionic Personality Scale (BHPS). Total = sum of the 11 items (each 1-4), range 11-44. Higher scores indicate greater histrionic personality traits (reverse-keyed items are reversed by the runtime). No standard severity cut-offs.",
